      "customData": {
        "sourceShapeId": "shape:mma-deploy-note-footer",
        "section": 5
      },
      "text": "Model layer: standard LLMManager centralizes chat / embed / rerank, task routing, fallbacks and health cooldowns. Pi has independent main-model settings and\nModelTransport.\nFull Compose starts a worker. In development, starting Redis does not imply a running worker.\nDeployment targets a single trusted workspace. Pi scope and token checks are not application-wide multi-tenant ACLs.\nThis is a static implementation map verified against main; it does not claim that every local container or external provider is currently online.",
      "originalText": "Model layer: standard LLMManager centralizes chat / embed / rerank, task routing, fallbacks and health cooldowns. Pi has independent main-model settings and ModelTransport.\nFull Compose starts a worker. In development, starting Redis does not imply a running worker.\nDeployment targets a single trusted workspace. Pi scope and token checks are not application-wide multi-tenant ACLs.\nThis is a static implementation map verified against main; it does not claim that every local container or external provider is currently online.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "mma-mma-deploy-note-footer",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
