      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "sourceShapeId": "shape:mma-pi-note-admission",
        "section": 4
      },
      "text": "Resource admission (defaults)\n\nRuns 2 / searches 1 / media 2.\nPi model concurrency is shared per provider.\nCatalog / index reads grant bounded\npriority to standard requests.\nOne host lock per data directory.\nSeparate Pi token / trusted-identity\nchecks.",
      "originalText": "Resource admission (defaults)\n\nRuns 2 / searches 1 / media 2.\nPi model concurrency is shared per provider.\nCatalog / index reads grant bounded priority to standard requests.\nOne host lock per data directory.\nSeparate Pi token / trusted-identity checks.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "mma-mma-pi-note-admission",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
