    {
      "id": "mma-mma-pi-note-independent-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5654,
      "y": 1407.75,
      "width": 392,
      "height": 364.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1d1d1d",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "mma-section-4"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 23690045,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793894400000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "sourceShapeId": "shape:mma-pi-note-independent",
        "section": 4
      },
      "text": "Independent from the standard path\n\nKnowledgeGateway accesses indexes\ndirectly.\nSearch is exact, or Dense + lexical fusion.\nIt does not reuse standard portrait\nrouting, RRF / Cross-Encoder\norchestration, or native CLIP / CLAP\nsearch.\n\nPi ModelTransport handles embeddings and\nmedia observation. Resolve models and\nconfig per run.\nStandard Decision switches do not control\nPi.",
      "originalText": "Independent from the standard path\n\nKnowledgeGateway accesses indexes directly.\nSearch is exact, or Dense + lexical fusion.\nIt does not reuse standard portrait routing, RRF / Cross-Encoder orchestration, or native CLIP / CLAP search.\n\nPi ModelTransport handles embeddings and media observation. Resolve models and config per run.\nStandard Decision switches do not control Pi.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "mma-mma-pi-note-independent",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "mma-mma-pi-note-plan-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6694,
      "y": 551.15,
      "width": 392,
      "height": 137.70000000000002,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1d1d1d",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "mma-section-4"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 89605270,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793894400000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "sourceShapeId": "shape:mma-pi-note-plan",
        "section": 4
      },
      "text": "Answer Plan is on by default; register before\nresearch.\nset_answer_requirements / check_answer\nbelong to experimental Answer Checks, off by\ndefault.\nKeep user quotes and delivery gaps in the plan.",
      "originalText": "Answer Plan is on by default; register before research.\nset_answer_requirements / check_answer\nbelong to experimental Answer Checks, off by default.\nKeep user quotes and delivery gaps in the plan.",
      "fontSize": 17,
