    {
      "id": "mma-mma-pi-note-footer-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5654,
      "y": 3451.4,
      "width": 1472,
      "height": 97.2,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1d1d1d",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "mma-section-4"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 26007839,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793894400000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "sourceShapeId": "shape:mma-pi-note-footer",
        "section": 4
      },
      "text": "Durable events cover model / tool starts and ends, evidence, context archives, resource waits, answers and terminal states. Missing usage receipts remain unknown.\nNo-progress guards cover repeated failures, repeated identical tool results, text-only turns, exhausted context and idle model streams; productive long tasks may\ncontinue.\nCitation checks establish delivered evidence identity, versions and positions, not semantic entailment. Discrete video samples do not prove frame-by-frame inspection.",
      "originalText": "Durable events cover model / tool starts and ends, evidence, context archives, resource waits, answers and terminal states. Missing usage receipts remain unknown.\nNo-progress guards cover repeated failures, repeated identical tool results, text-only turns, exhausted context and idle model streams; productive long tasks may continue.\nCitation checks establish delivered evidence identity, versions and positions, not semantic entailment. Discrete video samples do not prove frame-by-frame inspection.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
