      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793894400000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "sourceShapeId": "shape:mma-retrieval-note-rank",
        "section": 3
      },
      "text": "Retrieval & generation boundary\n\nQdrant serves vectors and payloads; MinIO\nserves originals and media.\nQueryEmbeddingCache separates model and\ninput identities.\nCoverage distinguishes not searched, no\ncandidates, filtered and not in context.\nUnsupported answers do not carry unused\ncandidate citations.",
      "originalText": "Retrieval & generation boundary\n\nQdrant serves vectors and payloads; MinIO serves originals and media.\nQueryEmbeddingCache separates model and input identities.\nCoverage distinguishes not searched, no candidates, filtered and not in context.\nUnsupported answers do not carry unused candidate citations.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "mma-mma-retrieval-note-rank",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
