      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "sourceShapeId": "shape:mma-retrieval-note-agent",
        "section": 3
      },
      "text": "Bounded Agent loop\n\nAnchor on the original question; planner\nchooses search / final.\nSubqueries reuse intent, scope, retrieval and\nreranking.\nRound / query / evidence budgets converge\ninto the shared generation chain.\nDisplayed budgets are configurable code\ndefaults.",
      "originalText": "Bounded Agent loop\n\nAnchor on the original question; planner chooses search / final.\nSubqueries reuse intent, scope, retrieval and reranking.\nRound / query / evidence budgets converge into the shared generation chain.\nDisplayed budgets are configurable code defaults.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "mma-mma-retrieval-note-agent",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "mma-IxmJIZk34wGrJ_scgfLNF-text",
