      },
      "text": "Tasks & recovery\n\nRegister the batch before background\nasyncio tasks start.\nRedis stores progress, leases, heartbeats\nand lost-worker status.\nRefresh can resume polling by processing_id.\nDocument parsing, chunks and Dense\nbatches have checkpoints.",
      "originalText": "Tasks & recovery\n\nRegister the batch before background asyncio tasks start.\nRedis stores progress, leases, heartbeats and lost-worker status.\nRefresh can resume polling by processing_id.\nDocument parsing, chunks and Dense batches have checkpoints.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "mma-mma-ingestion-note-status",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
