      "text": "Collection persistence: backend/data/collection/runs.sqlite3 stores runs and candidate receipts. Restart marks unfinished runs as interrupted.\nOriginal document text remains separate from generated descriptions. Keyframes enhance visual matching; they do not replace Shot semantics or time ranges.\nSource locations are relative to the repository. Native diagram objects retain their source text.",
